#
# Test file with an unusual VDOS, not intended for physics usage.
#
# Provenance:
#
#   The file HighNESS_DeuteratedGraphiteOxide_large_model_sg1_C18O3D2.ncmat
#   from the GraphiticData plugin (https://github.com/highness-eu/ncmat-
#   graphitic, commit 7e0bf65). Only the VDOS of one element was kept.
#
#   According to the original file, the phonon density of states was provided
#   by Marco Bernasconi and Debdipto Acharya from Universita di Milano-
#   Bicocca, and the file was generated by Shuqi Xu on behalf of Work Package
#   2 of the HighNESS project.
#
# Why it is a test case:
#
#   The energy grid is provided as a list of all points, which are not exactly
#   equidistant (the spacing varies between 0.495meV and 0.496meV). The
#   highest peak of the VDOS is the last point of the grid, and the values
#   span 86 orders of magnitude.
#
